%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: GoodMoniTIMEWOUND
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... I guess I can trust Monika with the truth.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: She's been trying her best, after all.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Well...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I think it's the best shot we have to going home.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177994
    - rid: 268099795830177995
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: You wanna go home that bad?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177996
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Do you not?!?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177997
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Of course I want to go home!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177998
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I miss <i>my</i> bed!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I miss my other friends!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I miss playing other games!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I miss school-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, nevermind. I don't miss school.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830177999
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: It probably gives me worse sleep-deprivation than adventuring does...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178000
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I miss <i>not having the world on my shoulders</i>!
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178001
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry, {mc}.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Honestly, I don't really have that much waiting for me back "home."
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178002
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But I guess, now that I think about it, there are certainly some perks
      that come from being back there.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178003
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Anyway, why do you think slaying Alduin and "fulfilling your destiny"
      will bring us home?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178004
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Actually, it was something Natsuki said.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: She said we were basically in an isekai.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And while those stories usually don't have the characters returning to
      their original lives-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The implication that we are here for some narrative purpose implies that
      once our purpose is fulfilled...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We might be able to go home.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: And what is my purpose if not to accomplish my destiny as the Last Dragonborn?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: If you're here to fulfill that narrative purpose, why are the rest of
      us here, then?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178005
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ... crap.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178006
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I hadn't thought of that...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Well, if this <i>is</i> an isekai, I guess they'd be the harem?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: But, if that's the case, they chose the wrong guy.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I'm <i>thoroughly</i> monogamous.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I dunno.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Maybe to do the guild quests?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: 'The player character can technically do all of them, even if it doesn''t
      make much sense:'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: The leader of the Companions, Thieves Guild, College of Winterhold, <i>and</i>
      Dark Brotherhood all being the same guy is... really odd.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178007
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I guess there's one of you for each guild, but we've sort of already
      broken from that template.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178008
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: And we'll magically get sent home, the same way we came here, if we do
      all of the "story" content?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178011
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: That's my best guess...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Not a bad guess if that entity is interested in telling a story.)
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (Although, why would it want us just to go through a story that's already
      been told?)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178012
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, we've almost reached the top.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 268099795830178013
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
